 Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Obk11u4CHhyqwkiJ517kaw","review_id":"YRxZnGnYPfq11yQaJqsJpw","date":"2020-11-17T04:38:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9308493733406067,"text_excerpt":"What more needs to be said about Willie Mae's? This place drops taste bomb after bomb in your mouth with its food. We ordered the family tray with fried chicken, and for sides had the fried okra, red beans, lima beans, mac and cheese, cornbread, and a bread pudding. Fried chicken is top notch. Honestly, though, after 1 piece I was done for. I would be curious to try the baked chicken here - I imagine it's just as tasty as the fried chicken without all the oil. Each side was better than the next; both types of rice and beans are outstanding. A little salty but dang dang delicious. Bread pudding was a little too sweet for my taste. All the above was for $45. A bargain for so much food (gave..."},{"business_id":"Obk11u4CHhyqwkiJ517kaw","review_id":"E0o5nQld-Cr34rRgizLUbQ","date":"2021-04-02T21:37:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9308307766914368,"text_excerpt":"Well I was recommended by a handful of friends to check out Willie Mae's while visiting NOLA. I learned that they recent opened up a second location inside a food hall. It was perfect, because we were cold, didn't want to wait in a long line, and wanted to eat. Thank goodness for this location, cause they made it so easy for us to enjoy Willie Mae's. We ordered a family meal which came with chicken, three sides, and biscuits. It was more than enough for four people! If coming to NOLA and looking for fried chicken, I'd say give this place a try! It was crunchy, greasy, and flavorful - just how you'd like your fried chicken to be. The biscuits were so good - I'm drooling as I think about th..."},{"business_id":"Obk11u4CHhyqwkiJ517kaw","review_id":"HLmx2SoCzTwB_dwXVK5s_w","date":"2021-07-12T15:18:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9292927384376526,"text_excerpt":"Full disclosure: I was a vegetarian for 3 years, but gave it up because I missed fried chicken. So yeah, you could say I'm a bit of a fried chicken fiend. We got the chicken sandwich, three-piece fried chicken (dark meat), and a smattering of sides. Oh my bawk, this was the best fried chicken I've ever had. I didn't know that chicken could be so juicy! I don't know what kind of magic they use but the seasoning permeates all the way through the meat. The dredge was also so flavorful and crispy - with just a tiny kick at the end. Honesty you just need to try it yourself because it was an experience. I have a feeling I will be seeing this fried chicken in my dreams. We were not huge fans of ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Obk11u4CHhyqwkiJ517kaw","photo_id":"XWMo9vaGRbiqhLZfqKPVYg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XWMo9vaGRbiqhLZfqKPVYg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8765882849693298},{"business_id":"Obk11u4CHhyqwkiJ517kaw","photo_id":"mFCSfQoTPz9gVWEuS9HdEA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/mFCSfQoTPz9gVWEuS9HdEA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8765882849693298},{"business_id":"Obk11u4CHhyqwkiJ517kaw","photo_id":"jQbCcRRVkbSfNUiDyoJtlg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jQbCcRRVkbSfNUiDyoJtlg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.857384979724884},{"business_id":"Obk11u4CHhyqwkiJ517kaw","photo_id":"dc9wxhrann0npjfycU3WsA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/dc9wxhrann0npjfycU3WsA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8512606620788574},{"business_id":"Obk11u4CHhyqwkiJ517kaw","photo_i